{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33944","headline":"奉詶鲁望惜春见寄 · 皮日休","name":"奉詶鲁望惜春见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十五日中春日好，可怜沈痼冷如灰。\n以前虽被愁将去，向後须教醉领来。\n梅片尽飘轻粉靥，柳芽初吐烂金醅。\n病中无限花番次，爲约东风且住开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33944.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33944","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}